# Context: repo root (proxy image).
# Bare names match root level; **/ variants cover nested dirs
# (e.g. services/proxy/node_modules would otherwise be sent to the daemon).
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
**/*.pyc
.venv
**/.venv
.git
.bob
supabase
workers
apps
services/api-demo
*.log
**/*.log
.env
**/.env
.turbo
coverage
